            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2> You find yourself in a big, empty house. There are Christmas lights around, yet no friends or family. <br>You are alone. Why?<br><br>Irony Of Nightmare is a game where things aren't as they seem. Those who choose to solve all the puzzles will unreval the true secrets of the house along with a completely different ending.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature list</h2> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Plunge into atmosphere of Christmas horror. If you are looking what to play in holidays — Irony of Nightmare is a perfect choice. <br></li><li>Feel the loneliness. There is only you and uninvited guest in the house. And soon he will catch you.<br></li><li>Explore dark and unsettling rooms in search for answers. Hidden messages and puzzles will help you uncover secrets of this strange place</li></ul>",
